OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny
OL,6,Fremaining showers will clear to leave
OL,7,Fa dry evening with some late sunny
OL,8,Fspells. The rest of the night will
OL,9,Fthen remain dry with clear periods.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FA dry and bright morning with
OL,12,Fsunny intervals, with increasing areas
OL,13,Fof cloud. Then a dry afternoon with
OL,14,Fsunny intervals turning hazier at
OL,15,Ftimes.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FRain
OL,18,Fspreads northwards on Monday, at times
OL,19,Fheavy and persistent. Further spells
OL,20,Fof rain or showers are likely on
OL,21,FTuesday and Wednesday.
